    "note": "Core v4 routes and parameters Omni calls before they reach the QA Swagger snapshot. Counts/GetBadgeCounts: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-07 (Web/Resgrid.Web.Services/Controllers/v4/CountsController.cs). Mapping/GetMapDataAndMarkers fullSizeIcons: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-11 (MappingController.cs, LegacyOmniPinIcons). Mapping/GetNearestDestinations, GetPoiCapabilities, SetPoiAvailability: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-13 (MappingController.cs, destination capabilities M0315). Mapping/GetDestinationRules, GetSuggestedDestinations: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-19 (MappingController.cs, destination rules M0317). The contract test overlays these on swagger-v4.json and fails once the snapshot has an entry, so remove each entry after refreshing the snapshot. Hand-written from Web/Resgrid.Web.Services/Controllers/v4/{RoutingController,RoutesController,MappingController}.cs. Calls/ReleaseUnit and Calls/ReleasePersonnel: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-16 (CallsController.cs, releasing a unit or person from an open call; ReleasePersonnel built in parallel with Omni RO-T152). RecurringCalls/*: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-17 (RecurringCallsController.cs, recurring calls and their dispatcher alerts, M0319/M0320). Routes/GetCallRoutePlans, StartCallRoute, ReachRouteStart and GetInstanceDirections includeStart: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-19 (RoutesController.cs, call start/destination locations and call routes, M0322; coded against the contract before Core landed). AiDestinations/GetAdvice, RequestAdvice, ApplyAdvice, DismissAdvice: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-19 (AiDestinationsController.cs, Enhanced AI destination advice, M0323; call-intake-and-ai-destinations-plan.md §7). CallResultData CallSource, IntakeChannelName and IntakeChannelType (components below; GetCall, GetActiveCalls, GetPendingCalls, GetCalls): Core develop working tree, 2026-11-19 (Models/v4/Calls/CallResult.cs, M0323). IntakeScreening/DismissAsSpam and CallResultData IntakeScreening: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-20 (IntakeScreeningController.cs, Models/v4/Calls/CallResult.cs; intake spam screening, M0326, plan §9). The contract test reads only paths; the components entry records the response fields Omni reads, for the next snapshot refresh to confirm. DispatcherDesk/*: Core dispatcher desk (dispatchers-on-duty-plan.md §4, M0324; hand-written from Models/v4/DispatcherDesk/DispatcherDeskModels.cs; SignOff, Heartbeat and SetAvailable take no body)."
